  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "MySQL is a multi-user, multi-threaded SQL database server. MySQL is a client/server implementation consisting of a server daemon (mysqld) and many different client programs and libraries. The base package contains the standard MySQL client programs and generic MySQL files.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* mysql: mysql: system takeover via mysqldump component (CVE-2026-101797)\n\n* mysql: mysql: unauthorized server takeover (CVE-2026-101772)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB component (CVE-2026-101724)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via client programs (CVE-2026-101754)\n\n* mysql: mysql: System takeover via client programs (CVE-2026-101770)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in Server Optimizer (CVE-2026-101732)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via server optimizer flaw (CVE-2026-101623)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via the Replication component (CVE-2026-101727)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via the audit component (CVE-2026-101748)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101747)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101617)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in Server Optimizer (CVE-2026-101607)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Complete server takeover via replication component (CVE-2026-101796)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service (CVE-2026-101778)\n\n* mysql: MySQL Server: Denial of service in the Server Optimizer (CVE-2026-101731)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in Group Replication plugin (CVE-2026-101776)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101609)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101760)\n\n* mysql: mysql: unauthorized data modification via replication component (CVE-2026-101775)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via Server Optimizer component (CVE-2026-101610)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via the C API (CVE-2026-101726)\n\n* mysql: mysql: unauthorized data modification via XML component (CVE-2026-101803)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in Group Replication (CVE-2026-101751)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via Server Optimizer flaw (CVE-2026-101787)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101619)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101622)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via the Optimizer component (CVE-2026-101789)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of service in replication component (CVE-2026-101766)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in Clone Plugin (CVE-2026-101750)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101618)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via the Server Replication component (CVE-2026-101729)\n\n* mysql: MySQL: Denial of Service via the Group Replication plugin (CVE-2026-101773)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via security encryption component (CVE-2026-101762)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101611)\n\n* mysql: mysql: unauthorized data access via improper privilege controls (CVE-2026-101800)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Partial Denial of Service via Telemetry component (CVE-2026-101779)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via Group Replication GCS (CVE-2026-101799)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101615)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via the Server Parser (CVE-2026-101802)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB component (CVE-2026-101627)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via Server Optimizer component (CVE-2026-101730)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via JSON component (CVE-2026-101733)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via the C API component (CVE-2026-101725)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via security encryption component (CVE-2026-101761)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in InnoDB (CVE-2026-101621)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service via Server Optimizer component (CVE-2026-101608)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of Service in Server Components Services (CVE-2026-101721)\n\n* mysql: mysql: Denial of service via DDL component (